rson","person_id":"cbr-p000611","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0456","start":456,"end":458,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0487","start":487,"end":489,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0500","start":500,"end":501,"surface":"樂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000611","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0508","start":508,"end":510,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0544","start":544,"end":546,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、官稱或待核指代；未補姓名、闕代與親屬成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0556","start":556,"end":558,"surface":"閻樂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000611","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p062:m0592","start":592,"end":594,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p009","text":"章邯已破項梁軍，則以為楚地兵不足憂，乃渡河擊趙，大破之。當此時，趙歇為王，陳餘為將，張耳為相，皆走入鉅鹿城。章邯令王離、涉閒圍鉅鹿，章邯軍其南，筑甬道而輸之粟。陳餘為將，將卒數萬人而軍鉅鹿之北，此所謂河北之軍也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"趙歇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000674","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000675","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000676","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"涉閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000677","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000675","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m009-0100","start":100,"end":104,"surface":"河北之軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p012","text":"項羽已殺卿子冠軍，威震楚國，名聞諸侯。乃遣當陽君、蒲將軍將卒二萬渡河，救鉅鹿。戰少利，陳餘復請兵。項羽乃悉引兵渡河，皆沈船，破釜甑，燒廬舍，持三日糧，以示士卒必死，無一還心。於是至則圍王離，與秦軍遇，九戰，絕其甬道，大破之，殺蘇角，虜王離。涉閒不降楚，自燒殺。當是時，楚兵冠諸侯。諸侯軍救鉅鹿下者十餘壁，莫敢縱兵。及楚擊秦，諸將皆從壁上觀。楚戰士無不一以當十，楚兵呼聲動天，諸侯軍無不人人惴恐。於是已破秦軍，項羽召見諸侯將，入轅門，無不膝行而前，莫敢仰視。項羽由是始為諸侯上將軍，諸侯皆屬焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"卿子冠軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"當陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000680","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"蒲將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000657","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000675","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"蘇角","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000681","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"涉閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000677","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0208","start":208,"end":211,"surface":"諸侯將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或短稱尚待逐處覆核；不補姓名或推造個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m012-0228","start":228,"end":230,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p015","text":"章邯已破項梁軍，則以為楚地兵不足憂，乃渡河，北擊趙，大破之。當是之時，趙歇為王，秦將王離圍之鉅鹿城，此所謂河北之軍也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m015-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m015-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"趙歇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000674","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m015-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p018","text":"當是時，秦兵彊，常乘勝逐北，諸將莫利先入關。獨項羽怨秦破項梁軍，奮，願與沛公西入關。懷王諸老將皆曰：「項羽為人彊悍猾賊。項羽嘗攻襄城，襄城無遺類，皆阬之，諸所過無不殘滅。且楚數進取，前陳王、項梁皆敗。不如更遣長者扶義而西，告諭秦父兄。秦父兄苦其主久矣，今誠得長者往，毋侵暴，宜可下。今項羽彊悍，今不可遣。獨沛公素寬大長者，可遣。」卒不許項羽，而遣沛公西略地，收陳王、項梁散卒。乃道碭至成陽，與杠裏秦軍夾壁，破（魏）［秦］二軍。楚軍出兵擊王離，大破之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000598","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000598","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000603","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m018-0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p021","text":"初，項羽與宋義北救趙，及項羽殺宋義，代為上將軍，諸將黥布皆屬，破秦將王離軍，降章邯，諸侯皆附。及趙高已殺二世，使人來，欲約分王關中。沛公以為詐，乃用張良計，使酈生、陸賈往說秦將，啗以利，因襲攻武關，破之。又與秦軍戰於藍田南，益張疑兵旗幟，諸所過毋得掠鹵，秦人喜，秦軍解，因大破之。又戰其北，大破之。乘勝，遂破之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"宋義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000671","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000575","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000535","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"張良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000687","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000764","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m021-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"陸賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000733","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p015","text":"章邯引兵至邯鄲，皆徙其民河内，夷其城郭。張耳與趙王歇走入鉅鹿城，王離圍之。陳餘北收常山兵，得數萬人，軍鉅鹿北。章邯軍鉅鹿南棘原，筑甬道屬河，餉王離。王離兵食多，急攻鉅鹿。鉅鹿城中食盡兵少，張耳數使人召前陳餘，陳餘自度兵少，不敵秦，不敢前。數月，張耳大怒，怨陳餘，使張黶、陳澤往讓陳餘曰：「始吾與公爲刎頸交，今王與耳旦暮且死，而公擁兵數萬，不肯相救，安在其相爲死！茍必信，胡不赴秦軍倶死？且有十一二相全。」陳餘曰：「吾度前終不能救趙，徒盡亡軍。且餘所以不倶死，欲爲趙王、張君報秦。今必倶死，如以肉委餓虎，何益？」張黶、陳澤曰：「事已急，要以倶死立信，安知後慮！」陳餘曰：「吾死顧以爲無益。必如公言。」乃使五千人令張黶、陳澤先嘗秦軍，至皆沒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005016","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"趙王歇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005004","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005017","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005016","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005017","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005017","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"張黶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005012","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"陳澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005018","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0234","start":234,"end":236,"surface":"張君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0255","start":255,"end":257,"surface":"張黶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005012","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0258","start":258,"end":260,"surface":"陳澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005018","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0280","start":280,"end":282,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0305","start":305,"end":307,"surface":"張黶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005012","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m015-0308","start":308,"end":310,"surface":"陳澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005018","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p016","text":"當是時，燕、齊、楚聞趙急，皆來救。張敖亦北收代兵，得萬餘人，來，皆壁餘旁，未敢撃秦。項羽兵數絶章邯甬道，王離軍乏食，項羽悉引兵渡河，遂破章邯。章邯引兵解，諸侯軍乃敢撃圍鉅鹿秦軍，遂虜王離。渉閒自殺。卒存鉅鹿者，楚力也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"張敖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005019","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005016","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005017","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005019","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005016","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005016","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"王離","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005017","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m016-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"渉閒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005020","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-006","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","source":{"title":"史記／卷006","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷006","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷006&oldid=7907969","revision_id":7907969,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"數位見證127個文字區塊